OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for most
OL,6,Fwith light winds. Overnight frost
OL,7,Fdeveloping in places, as well as the
OL,8,Fodd mist or fog patch possible.
OL,9,FCloudier around the north and west
OL,10,Fcoasts, some showers towards Caithness.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA mostly dry morning with
OL,13,Fbright or sunny spells, the odd shower
OL,14,Faround the coast. Showers spreading
OL,15,Fsouth to all parts later in the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
