OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FTurning colder Wednesday and Thursday
OL,7,Fas a freshening northerly wind brings
OL,8,Fbright spells and a few showers,
OL,9,Fperhaps wintry for a time. Bright
OL,10,Fspells and showers Friday. Overnight
OL,11,Ffrost possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
